# One human identity for this repository. The raw commits made before the
# identity was pinned still carry the old names; this maps them for every
# git command that reads authors (log, shortlog, blame, format-patch).
# The mapping is by email alone, so this file never has to repeat an old
# name in order to correct it. Bot commits are deliberately not mapped.
itswl <imwl@live.com> <imwl@live.com>
